ssues directly, with an available key and sufficient validity. Follow Create your first CA. Save its verified public certificate as `device-root.pem`."},"1593":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"Available global identifier `est-device-001`. This path uses automatic registration: do not create the device in the console first."},"1594":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#before-you-begin","content":"The approved root for Lamassu HTTPS in `est-trust.pem`, obtained through an independent channel. It can differ from the device CA; prepare networking/TLS in Deployment."},"1595":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-bootstrap-credential","content":"Issue a bootstrap leaf certificate with `CN=est-device-001`, its own key and Client Authentication use. Follow Issue and verify a certificate, changing its CN and saving the result as `bootstrap.crt` and `bootstrap.key`. Choose validity that covers this test and check the pair and chain."},"1596":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/enroll-device#prepare-the-bootstrap-credential","content":"The same root CA can issue it f