orm/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#before-you-begin","content":"Use an evaluation instance or an authority intended for these tests. The example creates a root that issues directly; to design an operational hierarchy, see Hierarchy and rotation."},"2419":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard-toc","content":"In **Certification Authorities**, select **Create New CA** and choose to create a CA with a new key pair."},"2420":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#open-the-creation-wizard-toc","content":"The &#x2A;*Create New CA (Existing Key)** flow is explained in the authorities guide."},"2421":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#select-the-key-toc","content":"Choose the engine that will keep the key and an algorithm its capabilities allow. For this example, you can use **EC P-384** if available."},"2422":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#select-the-key-toc","content":"The CA private key is used through the engine. In this path, you will download only the authority's public certificate."},"2423":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"Select **Root CA** and complete:"},"2424":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**CA Name**: `Acme Evaluation Root CA`."},"2425":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**Subject**: organization and country details for your evaluation."},"2426":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**CA Certificate Expiration**: for example, one year from creation."},"2427":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"**Default End-Entity Certificate Issuance Expiration**: for example, 90 days, within the CA's lifetime."},"2428":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#define-the-authority-toc","content":"The CA name becomes its `Common Name`. Keep the CA usages needed to sign certificates and CRLs."},"2429":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#review-and-create-the-ca-toc","content":"Check the engine, algorithm, subject, root type and dates. Confirm creation and note the authority identifier so you can recognize it in the DMS or API."},"2430":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verify-the-result-toc","content":"Open the new CA. It should appear active, show its certificate and allow access to **Issued Certificates**."},"2431":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#verify-the-result-toc","content":"Download or copy the authority's PEM certificate and save it as `ca.pem`. Check that the file contains the complete block, including `BEGIN CERTIFICATE` and `END CERTIFICATE`."},"2432":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#check-the-ca-certificate","content":"Run from the directory where you saved `ca.pem`:"},"2433":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#check-the-ca-certificate","content":"Check that the subject and issuer match the root you created, the dates include the current time, **Basic Constraints** contains `CA:TRUE` and **Key Usage** allows certificate signing. The last command should return `ca.pem: OK`."},"2434":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#check-the-ca-certificate","content":"You explicitly selected `ca.pem` as the trust anchor for this test. A valid self-signature does not install that trust in other consumers. See the openssl-verify reference for verification options."},"2435":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"If creation fails, check permissions, engine availability and the selected algorithm."},"2436":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"If OpenSSL cannot read the file, copy the complete PEM block again."},"2437":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"If signature or date checks fail, check that you downloaded this CA's certificate and that your computer's clock is correct."},"2438":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#if-the-result-fails","content":"PKI diagnostics covers issuance checks and cryptographic dependencies."},"2439":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/create-certificate-authority#next-step","content":"Continue with Issue and verify a certificate, using this authority and `ca.pem`."},"2440":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"page","content":"Issue and verify a certificate","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Platform","PKI","Getting started"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"Issue a client certificate and check content, chain and key correspondence."},"2442":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"Before you begin"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#start-the-issuance","content":"Start the issuance"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#choose-the-method","content":"Choose the method"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identify-the-certificate","content":"Identify the certificate"},"2446":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configure-key-and-uses","content":"Configure key and uses"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#issue-and-download","content":"Issue and download"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verify-the-result","content":"Verify the result"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inspect-content-and-dates","content":"Inspect content and dates"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verify-the-chain","content":"Verify the chain"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#check-that-the-key-matches","content":"Check that the key matches"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"If the result fails"},"2453":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#next-step","content":"Next step"},"2454":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","content":"You will issue an end-entity certificate for `device-001` using browser key and CSR generation. The result is `device.crt`, `device.key` and the issuing root's public certificate, `ca.pem`."},"2455":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"An active root CA with an available signing key and permission to issue. If one does not exist yet, follow Create your first CA."},"2456":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"Its public certificate in `ca.pem`; this example uses the root created in the previous path."},"2457":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"OpenSSL 3.x and a working directory with restricted access."},"2458":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"A client identifier: here we use `device-001`."},"2459":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#before-you-begin","content":"In this flow, the client's key is generated in the browser and must be downloaded when issuance finishes. If you lose it, you must generate a key and issue another certificate. The certificate inventory lets you download the public certificate, but cannot recover this key."},"2460":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#start-the-issuance","content":"Open the CA from the previous path, go to **Issued Certificates** and select **Issue New**."},"2461":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#choose-the-method","content":"Select **Generate Key & CSR in Browser** to follow this example."},"2462":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#choose-the-method","content":"If the key must be generated and kept on the destination system, use **Upload Existing CSR**, described in the authorities guide."},"2463":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identify-the-certificate","content":"Enter `device-001` as the `Common Name`. Add subject details required by your policy and SANs if the consumer uses them to identify the client."},"2464":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#identify-the-certificate","content":"If you continue with manual registration, the `Device ID` will be exactly `device-001`."},"2465":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configure-key-and-uses","content":"Choose an algorithm and size allowed by the profile; for example, ECDSA P-256 if permitted. For this client certificate, select **Digital Signature** and **Client Authentication**, and issue it as an end-entity certificate."},"2466":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#configure-key-and-uses","content":"Request, for example, 30 days of validity, always within the CA's lifetime. Review the issuance profile if the resulting content differs from the request."},"2467":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#issue-and-download","content":"Confirm issuance. Save the PEM certificate as `device.crt` and the private key as `device.key` in your prepared directory."},"2468":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verify-the-result","content":"Check in **Issued Certificates** that the certificate appears active. Note its serial number and verify the downloaded material using the checks below."},"2469":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#inspect-content-and-dates","content":"Check `CN=device-001`, the expected issuer, current validity, **Digital Signature** and the extended usage **TLS Web Client Authentication**. It must be an end-entity certificate: it must not declare `CA:TRUE` or enable **Certificate Sign**. If **Basic Constraints** is present, it must indicate `CA:FALSE`. If you requested SANs, check that the expected identifiers appear in the certificate."},"2470":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verify-the-chain","content":"The expected result is `device.crt: OK`. This check uses your explicit root and evaluates the chain, dates and compatibility with the TLS client purpose. Also check for the expected usages and names through the inspection above."},"2471":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verify-the-chain","content":"If you use an intermediate CA, the trusted root must be in `ca.pem` and you must supply the intermediates with `-untrusted intermediates.pem`. This variant is covered in the trust model."},"2472":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#verify-the-chain","content":"The command does not query OCSP or CRL. For revocation checks, continue with Certificate validation. See the openssl-verify reference for its options."},"2473":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#check-that-the-key-matches","content":"In Bash, compare the two public-key digests:"},"2474":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#check-that-the-key-matches","content":"Both commands must finish successfully and show the same SHA-256 digest. If they differ, the private key does not match the selected certificate. Find the correct pair before installing it."},"2475":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#check-that-the-key-matches","content":"The options used are documented in openssl-x509 and openssl-pkey."},"2476":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Result"},"2477":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"What to review"},"2478":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"The CA rejects issuance"},"2479":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Permissions, CA state and key, algorithm and profile."},"2480":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Different subject or usages"},"2481":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-40","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Applied profile and requested values."},"2482":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-41","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Issuer cannot be found"},"2483":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-42","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Downloaded CA and required intermediate chain."},"2484":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-43","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Validity fails"},"2485":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-44","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Certificate and CA dates, and the computer's clock."},"2486":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-45","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Public-key digests differ"},"2487":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-46","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"Certificate and key files from the same issuance."},"2488":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate-47","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/pki/quickstarts/issue-certificate#if-the-result-fails","content":"See PKI diagnostics to narrow an issuance failure."},"2489":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/