":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture#where-things-are-stored","content":"Native mode also uses `update_files_base_dir` as build scratch space: it stages a build's inputs there, and the built outputs are published to the `builds` store."},"2666":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture#running-more-than-one-replica","content":"The background work (the WFX event consumer and the scheduled-launch trigger) runs on exactly one replica at a time. Leader election picks it: Kubernetes Leases when running inside a cluster, a Postgres advisory lock elsewhere, configurable with `leader_election.mode` (`\"\"`, `kubernetes` or `database`). Without election every replica would count the same job completions and release batches early, so a failure to configure it stops the service at start-up. Batch dispatch is also protected by a per-launch lock, so two callers never send the same batch twice."},"2667":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture#running-more-than-one-replica","content":"If `builds` is on local disk the service logs a warning and the deployment is limited to one replica, because other replicas could not serve the builds. Put `builds`, `artifacts` and the SymKMS store on S3 to scale out. See Operations."},"2668":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture-109","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/architecture#next-steps","content":"<Card title=\"Flows\" description=\"The sequence of every important operation.\" hr