rence/api-251","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#request-bodies","content":"`POST .../new`"},"4272":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-252","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#request-bodies","content":"`{\"version\":\"x.y.z\"}`: semver, and greater than the current version, or `400`"},"4273":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-253","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#request-bodies","content":"`PUT .../preconditions`"},"4274":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-254","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#request-bodies","content":"`{\"preconditions\":[{\"required_distribution_set_name\":\"...\",\"min_version\":\"1.2.0\"}]}`. Use `required_module_key` (`type:name`) instead of the pack name to target a module. Exactly one of the two per entry, and `min_version` must be `x.y.z`. A device must satisfy every entry"},"4275":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-255","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#request-bodies","content":"`POST .../swu`, `.../package`"},"4276":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-256","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#request-bodies","content":"`user`, `encryption_key_name`, `encryption_alg_name`, `sw_desc_encrypted`, `signature_key_id`, `signature_alg_name`, `signature_certificate` (PEM), `selected_artifact_ids`. All optional, but `user` is required with `encryption_key_name`. A body with `encryption_alg_name` only requests per-device encryption. An empty or invalid body builds without encryption. See Signing and encryption"},"4277":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-257","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#request-bodies","content":"Artifacts reach a build only through `selected_artifact_ids`; without them there is normally nothing staged and the build fails. A build replaces the pack's carried artifact links with the selected ones."},"4278":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-258","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#responses","content":"Create routes answer `201` with the object: a pack, a module, or for a launch the launch ID and the precondition outcome. `modules` is an input of pack creation and is not returned on reads."},"4279":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-259","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#responses","content":"`DELETE` of a pack answers `200` with `{\"message\": \"...\"}`. `POST .../new`, `.../swu` and `.../package` answer `200` with `{\"message\": \"...\"}`."},"4280":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api-260","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/api#responses","content":"Artifact uploads answer `{\"msg\": \"...\", \"artifact\": {...}}`: `201` for `POST /artifacts`, `200` for the pack-scoped and module-scoped uploads."},"4281":{"id":"/docs/pr-p