(connections are recycled after 30 minutes, or 5 idle minutes). Budget `25 x replicas` against the `max_connections` of Postgres."},"4865":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-123","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Key"},"4866":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-124","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Default"},"4867":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-125","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Mode"},"4868":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-126","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Description"},"4869":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-127","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"`dms_endpoint`"},"4870":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-128","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"none"},"4871":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-129","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Required in `native`, optional in `hawkbit`"},"4872":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-130","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Base URL of the Lamassu Device Manager API, for example `http://host:8080/api/devmanager`. It is the source of device groups. Without it in `hawkbit` mode, groups are read from the `group:<id>` tags of the hawkBit targets. The service sends `X-Principal-ID: admin-mode` on these calls."},"4873":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-131","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"`kms_endpoint`"},"4874":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-132","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"none"},"4875":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-133","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Both"},"4876":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-134","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Base URL of the Lamassu KMS API, for example `http://host:8080/api/kms/v1`. Needed to sign. See Signing and encryption."},"4877":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-135","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"`symkms_endpoint`"},"4878":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-136","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"none"},"4879":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-137","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Both"},"4880":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-138","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"Base URL of SymKMS, **without** the `/symkms/v1` path. In the monolith it points at the service itself (for example `http://localhost:10090`) and must match `app.server.port`. Empty means encryption is refused."},"4881":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration-139","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-of-other-services","content":"`wfx_endpoint`"},"4882":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/refe