/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#starting-the-service","content":"Debug output shows secrets"},"5361":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-75","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#starting-the-service","content":"`app.logs.level: debug` prints the configuration"},"5362":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-76","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#starting-the-service","content":"Use `info`. See Security."},"5363":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-77","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Symptom or message"},"5364":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-78","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Likely cause"},"5365":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-79","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Fix"},"5366":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-80","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"`501 Not Implemented`"},"5367":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-81","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"The active backend does not support the operation"},"5368":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-82","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Read `GET /updates/v1/capabilities`. In `hawkbit` mode, `POST .../swu` and `.../package` always answer `501`: build the modules in the catalog."},"5369":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"`409` `update pack version X is already built; create a new version ...`"},"5370":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"You changed a built version"},"5371":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Native mode: `POST .../new` with `{\"version\":\"x.y.z\"}` greater than the current one, then upload the sw-description again (it is not carried over) and give any re-uploaded artifact a higher `version`. `hawkbit` mode: see the next row."},"5372":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"`hawkbit mode: cannot ... here — a software module linked to a distribution set is frozen` (`400`)"},"5373":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Pack-scoped edits are refused in `hawkbit` mode"},"5374":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Unlink the module, change and build it in the catalog, link it again. Or release a new version of the module and create a pack from it under another name: pack names are unique per group, and an `os` module cannot be swapped on an existing pack. See hawkBit mode."},"5375":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"`409` `... is being built or changed by another request; retry when it finishes`"},"5376":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Two builds, or a build and a change, on the same pack or module"},"5377":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Wait and retry. The lock is released when the operation ends or fails."},"5378":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"`409` on create"},"5379":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"A pack with that name exists in the group"},"5380":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Pick another name."},"5381":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"`413` `file \"x\" is N MiB; the maximum upload size is M MiB`"},"5382":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"The file exceeds `max_artifact_size_mb`"},"5383":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Raise it, and the limits of every proxy in front. See Operations. A proxy answering `413` with its own body (for example nginx's default 1 MiB) is the proxy, not the service."},"5384":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting-98","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/platform/updates/troubleshooting#api-calls","content":"Upload `400` mentioning content that contradicts the filename"},"5385":{"id":"/docs/pr-previe