iew/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"Con `--development`, la contraseña fija `lamassu`/`lamassu` concede acceso `pki-admin` a cualquiera que alcance la instalación. No lo uses nunca en nada expuesto más allá de una máquina de desarrollo o de un host accesible por red."},"180":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#modo-de-desarrollo","content":"`--development` se aplica cuando el realm `lamassu` se importa por primera vez. No modifica un clúster existente. Puede combinarse con `--sample-data`: la transformación de desarrollo se ejecuta primero y después se añaden los datos de ejemplo a la misma configuración del realm."},"181":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"Fastlane:"},"182":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"valida las herramientas locales y el clúster seleccionado"},"183":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane#qué-configura-el-script","content":"instala o actualiza Envoy Gateway 1.8 y crea la `GatewayClass` `eg`"},"184":{"id":"/docs/pr-p