f-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Diseño avanzado; el front door usa TLS passthrough y cada Gateway termina su propio TLS"},"312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-51","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Recursos Gateway separados pero proxy compartido"},"313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-52","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Modo merged Gateway de Envoy"},"314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-53","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Solo separación lógica; cada listener necesita una tupla única de puerto, protocolo y hostname"},"315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-54","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Tres Services `LoadBalancer` independientes no pueden reservar a la vez los mismos puertos 80 y 443 mediante K3s ServiceLB. Usa un Gateway compartido, asigna VIP distintas con otro balanceador o utiliza puertos diferentes."},"316":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-55","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Envoy Gateway provisiona normalmente un proxy fleet por `Gateway`. Su modo merged Gateway puede compartir un fleet y una dirección, pero no es un cambio directo para varias releases de Lamassu: los listeners generados usan los mismos puertos y protocolos sin hostnames distintos, por lo que entran en conflicto salvo que personalices el diseño."},"317":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-56","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Usa un front door con SNI solo cuando los Gateways internos deban mantener políticas TLS o mTLS independientes:"},"318":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-57","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#qué-ocurre-si-necesitas-tres-gateways","content":"Esto requiere hostnames SNI distintos y configuración de red externa al chart de Lamassu."},"319":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-58","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si un Gateway puede gestionar TLS y el enrutamiento, usa el valor predeterminado del chart."},"320":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los Gateways necesitan políticas independientes y puedes asignar IP, usa una VIP por Gateway."},"321":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si solo necesitas separar los recursos Kubernetes, evalúa merged Gateway y usa tuplas de listener únicas."},"322":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si los data planes y la terminación TLS deben ser independientes detrás de una IP, añade un front door con TLS passthrough y SNI."},"323":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#guía-de-decisión","content":"Si nada de lo anterior es posible, usa puertos externos distintos o cambia el diseño de red."},"324":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-de-salida","content":"Los clientes internos de Lamassu — la conexión con el motor de Vault, las llamadas entre servicios y los webhooks salientes — respetan las variables de entorno `HTTP_PROXY`, `HTTPS_PROXY` y `NO_PROXY`. La excepción es el conector del motor de autorización: usa su propio transporte y no consulta estas variables de proxy. Si tu despliegue enruta el tráfico de salida por un proxy, incluye los nombres de servicio internos del clúster en `NO_PROXY` (por ejemplo `.svc,.cluster.local`) para que el tráfico interno permanezca dentro del clúster. El tráfico de loopback nunca se envía por un proxy."},"325":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#proxy-de-salida","content":"El transporte predeterminado de estos clientes acota el timeout de conexión (30 segundos), el handshake TLS (10 segundos) y la reutilización de conexiones inactivas (90 segundos), de modo que una dependencia inalcanzable falla rápido en lugar de bloquearse; estos valores son los predeterminados del transporte de Go, no configuración de Lamassu. HTTP/2 se negocia cuando el otro extremo lo soporta. El conector del motor de autorización mantiene su propio transporte sin estos timeouts de conexión ni de handshake TLS; solo su timeout global de petición de 30 segundos acota cada llamada."},"326":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-65","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Comprueba, en orden:"},"327":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-66","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El `Gateway` muestra `Accepted=True` y `Programmed=True`."},"328":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-67","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Su estado contiene la dirección esperada."},"329":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-68","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El Service `LoadBalancer` generado tiene una dirección externa utilizable."},"330":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-69","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El puerto 443 de esa dirección es accesible desde la red del cliente."},"331":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-70","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"DNS resuelve al endpoint accesible externamente."},"332":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-71","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"El certificado contiene el nombre DNS o la IP usada por el cliente."},"333":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking-72","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking#verifica-la-ruta-de-tráfico","content":"Gateway API trata las direcciones como estado deseado que el controlador puede asignar o rechazar; consulta la introducción a Gateway API para conocer el modelo."},"334":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"page","content":"Kubernetes self-managed","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Despliegue","Kubernetes autogestionado"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview"},"335":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","content":"Elige un flujo de instalación y una arquitectura de red para Lamassu en tu clúster Kubernetes."},"336":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#despliegue-self-managed-con-kubernetes","content":"Despliegue self-managed con Kubernetes"},"337":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Elige un flujo de instalación"},"338":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#qué-proporciona-el-chart-de-lamassu","content":"Qué proporciona el chart de Lamassu"},"339":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#cómo-encaja-el-despliegue","content":"Cómo encaja el despliegue"},"340":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#requisitos-de-plataforma","content":"Requisitos de plataforma"},"341":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-la-siguiente-página","content":"Elige la siguiente página"},"342":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#despliegue-self-managed-con-kubernetes","content":"Ejecuta Lamassu en un clúster Kubernetes operado por tu equipo. El chart Helm despliega los servicios de Lamassu y sus recursos de enrutamiento; tú proporcionas el clúster, el almacenamiento persistente, el proveedor de identidad, PostgreSQL, RabbitMQ y la ruta de red utilizada por los clientes."},"343":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Flujo"},"344":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Úsalo para"},"345":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Qué instala"},"346":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview#elige-un-flujo-de-instalación","content":"Helm"},"347":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/deployment/self-hosted/overview-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-p