-59","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#permisos-iam-necesarios","content":"Para el mecanismo de desconexión forzada tras revocación también se requiere acceso a la API del plano de datos de AWS IoT (`iot:Connect` con SigV4 sobre WebSocket), que se negocia de forma implícita con las credenciales del conector."},"1311":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-60","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#parámetros-de-configuración","content":"Parámetro"},"1312":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-61","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#parámetros-de-configuración","content":"Tipo"},"1313":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-62","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#parámetros-de-configuración","content":"Requerido"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-63","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core#parámetros-de-configuración","content":"Descripción"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core-64","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/integrations/aws-iot-core","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/