nación modifica el inventario de Lamassu. La clave y el certificado se instalan por separado en el dispositivo; la conexión con un consumidor se comprueba en la integración de ese destino."},"1664":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una instancia accesible y permisos para administrar DMS, dispositivos y la asociación de certificados."},"1665":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Una CA activa con clave disponible. Si todavía no existe, sigue Crea tu primera CA."},"1666":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"Un certificado final activo de esa CA cuyo `Common Name` sea exactamente `device-001`, con su clave privada. Sigue Emite y verifica un certificado para obtener y comprobar ambos."},"1667":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#antes-de-empezar","content":"El identificador `device-001` libre en el inventario. Si ya lo usaste, elige otro y emite el certificado con ese mismo `Common Name`."},"1668":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Un DMS debe existir antes de registrar el dispositivo. Si ya tienes uno adecuado, comprueba su CA y anota su identificador; si necesitas crearlo:"},"1669":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Abre el inventario de DMS y la acción de creación. Asigna un nombre reconocible, como `Acme Evaluation DMS`."},"1670":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Enrollment CA**, selecciona la CA que emitió `device.crt`."},"1671":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En **Registration Mode**, selecciona `PRE_REGISTRATION` para el recorrido que comienza con un alta explícita."},"1672":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"En la sección de autenticación, activa **Require client certificate** y deja **Call external webhook** desactivado. Bajo **Require client certificate**, añade a **Validation CAs** la CA cuyos certificados iniciales aceptarás; para esta evaluación puede ser la misma CA. Mantén habilitada **Verify CSR Signature** y deja **Enable server-side key generation** desactivado si no lo vas a utilizar."},"1673":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Revisa los ajustes de renovación y distribución de confianza con la guía DMS, guarda el servicio y anota su identificador."},"1674":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Vuelve a abrir el DMS y confirma que la CA de enrolamiento es la prevista y que el servicio aparece en el inventario."},"1675":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-23","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#prepara-el-dms","content":"Estos ajustes preparan la política DMS. Los pasos siguientes realizan el alta y la asignación desde la consola; no envían una solicitud EST ni prueban la admisión por ese protocolo."},"1676":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-24","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Abre **Managed Devices** y la acción de registro. Completa:"},"1677":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-25","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Device ID**: `device-001`."},"1678":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-26","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Registration Authority**: el DMS que acabas de preparar; la etiqueta identifica al servicio que cumple el rol de autoridad de registro."},"1679":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-27","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"**Icon** y **Tags**: clasificación opcional."},"1680":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-28","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#registra-el-dispositivo","content":"Confirma el registro."},"1681":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-29","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"Abre el dispositivo. Debe aparecer en **No Identity** y mostrar el DMS propietario seleccionado."},"1682":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-30","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#comprueba-el-estado-inicial","content":"El registro crea la entrada de inventario; el certificado todavía debe asociarse."},"1683":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-31","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Selecciona **Assign Identity** y el certificado existente con `CN=device-001`. Comprueba su número de serie, emisor y vigencia frente al certificado que verificaste en PKI."},"1684":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-32","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#asigna-una-identidad","content":"Confirma la asociación. La alternativa **Issue New Instead** se explica en Dispositivos e identidades."},"1685":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-33","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#verifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Comprueba que tiene una identidad activa. En **Certificate History**, verifica el número de serie asociado; en **Device Event Timeline**, localiza el evento de asignación."},"1686":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-34","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#verifica-el-dispositivo","content":"Conserva el identificador del dispositivo, el DMS propietario y el número de serie como referencias del resultado."},"1687":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-35","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Comprobación"},"1688":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-36","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Resultado"},"1689":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-37","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Dispositivo"},"1690":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-38","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"`device-001` aparece en el inventario con el DMS previsto."},"1691":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device-39","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/iot-fleets/quickstarts/register-device#resultado-esperado","content":"Identidad actual"},"1692":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/i