l-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Marcar como completado (terminal)"},"3574":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"`POST .../complete`"},"3575":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-100","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"No disponible en modo hawkBit"},"3576":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Leer o cambiar la estrategia"},"3577":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"`GET`, `PUT .../strategy`"},"3578":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"Cambiarla no está disponible en modo hawkBit"},"3579":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#5-lánzalo","content":"En modo hawkBit, un rollout solo se puede pausar después de que haya empezado a despachar."},"3580":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-105","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#verifica-el-resultado","content":"El listado de lanzamientos responde `{\"list\":[...],\"next\":\"...\"}`. Un lanzamiento ha terminado cuando `pending_count` y `active_count` valen cero; un lanzamiento nativo pone entonces su `status` en `completed` por sí solo. Los dispositivos terminan como `completed` (estado del trabajo `ACTIVATED`, o `INSTALLED` para `non-swu`) o `failed` (`TERMINATED`)."},"3581":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-106","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#publica-la-siguiente-versión","content":"Una versión construida de un paquete es inmutable. Para cambiarla, crea la versión siguiente, sube lo que haya cambiado y construye de nuevo:"},"3582":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-107","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#publica-la-siguiente-versión","content":"La versión debe ser estrictamente mayor que la actual. La versión nueva empieza sin construir y arrastra los artefactos actuales."},"3583":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-108","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#publica-la-siguiente-versión","content":"Para actualizar un dispositivo a una versión exacta sin campaña, usa `POST $API/devices/<device-id>/force-version` con `{\"distribution_set_id\":\"<pack id>\",\"version\":\"1.1.0\"}`; en modo nativo crea un lanzamiento de un solo dispositivo y usa por defecto el workflow `phased` para paquetes SWU (`download-install` para `non-swu`), salvo que indiques un `workflow`."},"3584":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-109","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Los paquetes de hawkBit se ensamblan a partir de módulos del catálogo ya construidos, así que los pasos 2 y 3 del lado del paquete pasan al catálogo:"},"3585":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-110","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Crea el módulo: `POST $API/softwaremodules` con `type` (`os` o `application`), `name`, `version` y un `delivery_intent`: `swu-build`, `swu-prebuilt` o `raw`. `undecided` se acepta, pero un módulo no puede entrar en un paquete hasta que elijas."},"3586":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-111","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Sube el fichero con `POST $API/softwaremodules/by-id/<id>/artifacts`. Para `swu-build`, sube también el `sw-description` a `.../descriptor` y llama a `POST $API/softwaremodules/by-id/<id>/build`. Para `swu-prebuilt`, subir el `.swu` es la construcción. Para `raw`, llama a `.../build` para que los ficheros sean el entregable; firmar y cifrar es opcional."},"3587":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-112","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Crea el paquete con `\"modules\":[{\"source_module_id\":\"<id>\"}]`. Se crea ya construido."},"3588":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-113","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#modo-hawkbit","content":"Después continúa en el paso 4. Los detalles, incluidas las intenciones de entrega, están en Modo hawkBit, y una secuencia completa de peticiones en la guía curl de hawkBit."},"3589":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-114","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"Síntoma"},"3590":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-115","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"Causa probable"},"3591":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-116","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"Una llamada devuelve `501 Not Implemented`"},"3592":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-117","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"El backend activo no la admite. Consulta Capacidades"},"3593":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-118","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"`400` «has not been built yet» al crear un lanzamiento"},"3594":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-119","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"El paquete está en `draft` o `build_failed`. Constrúyelo primero"},"3595":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-120","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"`400` sobre dispositivos sin paquete"},"3596":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-121","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out#solución-de-problemas","content":"Un paquete cifrado por dispositivo se construyó solo para algunos. El mensaje nombra los dispositivos sin clave; corrígelos y reconstruye"},"3597":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/guides/publish-and-roll-out-122","page_id":"/d