apabilities-83","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"Condicional"},"4719":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-84","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"`software_module_deliverables`: cada módulo tiene su propio entregable"},"4720":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-85","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"**No**"},"4721":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-86","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"Sí"},"4722":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-87","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"`standalone_software_modules`: crear un módulo sin pack"},"4723":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-88","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"Sí"},"4724":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-89","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"Condicional"},"4725":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-90","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"`software_module_replace`: sustituir un módulo por otra versión de sí mismo"},"4726":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-91","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"**No**"},"4727":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-92","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#soporte-por-backend","content":"Condicional"},"4728":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-93","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-condicionales-en-modo-hawkbit","content":"**`artifact_encryption`** se informa como no admitida solo cuando no está configurado ninguno de `swugenerator_path`, `symkms_endpoint` y `kms_endpoint`. Cada opción de compilación sigue necesitando su propia configuración: consulta Firma y cifrado."},"4729":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-94","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-condicionales-en-modo-hawkbit","content":"**`software_module_composition`, `standalone_software_modules` y `software_module_replace`** dependen de que el servidor hawkBit tenga los tipos de módulo preinstalados `os` y `application` y el tipo de conjunto `os_app` o `app`. El servicio lo sondea con un timeout de 5 segundos, guarda el resultado unos cinco minutos y asume que hay soporte cuando hawkBit no responde. Si el sondeo falla, las tres capacidades se informan juntas como no admitidas."},"4730":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-95","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-condicionales-en-modo-hawkbit","content":"**`software_module_deliverables`** siempre se informa como admitida en modo hawkBit. Compilar un módulo `swu-build` sigue necesitando un `swugenerator_path`; sin él, la compilación responde `501`."},"4731":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-96","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-condicionales-en-modo-hawkbit","content":"**`prebuilt_deliverable`**: un pack de hawkBit nunca se compila directamente. Un módulo `swu-prebuilt` del catálogo acepta en su lugar un `.swu` terminado."},"4732":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-97","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-cuyo-significado-cambia","content":"Ambos backends informan `software_module_composition`, pero importar un módulo lo **enlaza** en modo hawkBit (ambos packs comparten un único módulo) y lo **copia** en modo native. La lista de módulos reutilizables lo indica por candidato en su campo `shared`, de modo que un cliente puede decirle al operador cuál de los dos casos tiene. Consulta Conceptos."},"4733":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-98","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#capacidades-cuyo-significado-cambia","content":"En modo native un lanzamiento despacha un job por dispositivo con una única URI de descarga, así que un módulo no tiene entregable propio: el pack compila un único `.swu` a partir de las entradas de todos sus módulos. Por eso `software_module_deliverables` y `software_module_replace` no están admitidas allí."},"4734":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-99","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#qué-debe-hacer-un-cliente","content":"Llama a `capabilities` una vez al arrancar y antes de mostrar una función que la tabla marque como dependiente del backend."},"4735":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-100","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#qué-debe-hacer-un-cliente","content":"Trata un `501` en una ruta como definitivo: oculta la acción en lugar de reintentar."},"4736":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-101","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#qué-debe-hacer-un-cliente","content":"No deduzcas el backend por la URL. Ambos sirven las mismas rutas `/updates/v1`; consulta la Referencia de la API para saber qué rutas responden `501` en cada backend."},"4737":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-102","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#qué-debe-hacer-un-cliente","content":"Vuelve a leer las capacidades tras cambiar los tipos de módulo de hawkBit o la configuración de compilación."},"4738":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-103","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#siguientes-pasos","content":"Referencia de la API"},"4739":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities-104","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/capabilities#siguientes-pasos","content":"Modo hawkBit"},"4740":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"page","content":"Referencia de configuración","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","[Enterprise] Actualizaciones","Referencia"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration"},"4741":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","content":"Todas las claves de configuración de Lamassu Updates, su valor por defecto, qué backend las lee y cómo sobrescribirlas con variables de entorno."},"4742":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-carga-la-configuración","content":"Cómo se carga la configuración"},"4743":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#qué-claves-lee-cada-modo","content":"Qué claves lee cada modo"},"4744":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#ajustes-generales-y-del-servidor","content":"Ajustes generales y del servidor"},"4745":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#base-de-datos","content":"Base de datos"},"4746":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#endpoints-de-otros-servicios","content":"Endpoints de otros servicios"},"4747":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#construcción-y-firma","content":"Construcción y firma"},"4748":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#límites-de-subida","content":"Límites de subida"},"4749":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-8","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloques-de-almacenamiento-de-blobs","content":"Bloques de almacenamiento de blobs"},"4750":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-9","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#almacenamiento-storage","content":"Almacenamiento (`*.storage`)"},"4751":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-10","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"Cifrado en reposo (`*.encryption`)"},"4752":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-11","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Descargas prefirmadas (`*.presign`)"},"4753":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-12","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Bloque `hawkbit`"},"4754":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-13","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Variables de entorno"},"4755":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-14","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#configuraciones-mínimas","content":"Configuraciones mínimas"},"4756":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-15","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#symkms-como-proceso-independiente","content":"SymKMS como proceso independiente"},"4757":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-16","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#páginas-relacionadas","content":"Páginas relacionadas"},"4758":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-17","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","content":"Lamassu Updates lee un único fichero YAML al arrancar. Esta página lista todas las claves que lee el código, su valor por defecto y qué backend (`native` o `hawkbit`) las usa. Las claves que aparecen en los ficheros de ejemplo pero no se leen se indican aparte para que no confíes en ellas."},"4759":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-18","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-carga-la-configuración","content":"Indica la ubicación del fichero con la variable de entorno `OTA_CONFIG_FILE`. Si no está definida, el servicio lee `/etc/lamassuiot/config.yml`, que es donde la imagen Docker y el chart de Helm lo montan."},"4760":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-19","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-carga-la-configuración","content":"Si `OTA_CONFIG_FILE` apunta a un fichero que no se puede cargar (no existe, o el YAML no es válido), el servicio registra una advertencia y &#x2A;*recurre a `/etc/lamassuiot/config.yml`**. En la imagen Docker esa ruta contiene el `config.yml` de desarrollo del repositorio, así que un error al escribir la ruta puede arrancar el servicio con una configuración equivocada. Si esa alternativa también falla, el servicio termina."},"4761":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-20","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-carga-la-configuración","content":"El fichero se lee una sola vez. Reinicia el servicio tras cualquier cambio."},"4762":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-21","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-carga-la-configuración","content":"`LAMASSU_CONFIG_FILE`, que definen el Dockerfile y el chart de Helm, no lo lee el código. Solo importa `OTA_CONFIG_FILE`."},"4763":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-22","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cómo-se-c