tent":"Obligatoria para `awskms`: ARN o alias de la clave."},"4989":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-248","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"`awskms_region`"},"4990":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-249","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"`us-east-1`"},"4991":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-250","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"Región de la clave de AWS KMS."},"4992":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-251","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#cifrado-en-reposo-encryption","content":"Un objeto cifrado se cifra y descifra entero, en memoria: con cifrado en reposo, leer o escribir un artefacto de 10 GiB necesita esa misma memoria, y los rangos de bytes se cortan de la copia descifrada. Un almacén con el cifrado activado no puede usar descargas prefirmadas. Para ficheros grandes, es preferible cifrar en el propio almacén (por ejemplo, con cifrado del lado del servidor de S3)."},"4993":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-252","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Con almacenamiento S3, una descarga puede responderse con `302` a una URL firmada de corta duración del almacén, en lugar de transmitir los bytes a través del servicio. Antes se autoriza al solicitante, como en cualquier descarga. El modo `native` firma las salidas de compilación (`builds.presign`); el modo `hawkbit` firma los objetos del plugin S3 de hawkBit (`hawkbit.artifact_store.presign`). Las descargas de artefactos por ID en modo `native` siempre se transmiten a través del servicio."},"4994":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-253","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Clave"},"4995":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-254","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Por defecto"},"4996":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-255","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Descripción"},"4997":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-256","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`enabled`"},"4998":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-257","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`false`"},"4999":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-258","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Activa la función."},"5000":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-259","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`public_endpoint`"},"5001":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-260","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"el `s3_endpoint` del almacenamiento"},"5002":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-261","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Origen del almacén **tal como lo alcanzan los dispositivos**, sin ruta (por ejemplo, el gateway que publica el bucket). Es lo que se firma: la firma cubre la cabecera `Host`, así que una URL firmada para una dirección interna del clúster se rechaza cuando un dispositivo la usa a través del gateway. Obligatoria salvo que los dispositivos alcancen el almacén en su propio endpoint (por ejemplo, AWS S3)."},"5003":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-262","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`ttl`"},"5004":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-263","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`60s`"},"5005":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-264","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Cuánto tiempo puede una URL **iniciar** una descarga. Entre `1s` y 7 días. Una transferencia ya en curso no se corta al caducar."},"5006":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-265","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`min_remaining`"},"5007":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-266","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`min(25s, ttl/2)`"},"5008":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-267","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Una URL ya firmada para el mismo objeto se entrega de nuevo mientras le quede al menos esta validez, de modo que un reintento o una reanudación nunca recibe una URL a punto de caducar. Un valor negativo firma una URL nueva en cada petición. Debe ser menor que `ttl`."},"5009":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-268","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"`access_key_id`, `secret_access_key` (o las variantes `_file`)"},"5010":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-269","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"ninguno"},"5011":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-270","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"La credencial que firma. &#x2A;*Obligatoria, y debe ser una credencial de solo lectura distinta de la del almacenamiento.**"},"5012":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-271","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#descargas-prefirmadas-presign","content":"Al arrancar, el servicio se niega a ejecutarse si la credencial de firma es la del almacenamiento, si puede escribir en el bucket (lo comprueba intentando una escritura), si el almacén la rechaza (espera hasta 2 minutos a que el almacén la acepte) o si `encryption.type` no es `none` (los dispositivos recibirían texto cifrado). Si no se puede consultar el almacén en absoluto, registra una advertencia y continúa. El dispositivo debe poder resolver y alcanzar `public_endpoint`. Consulta Seguridad."},"5013":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-272","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Se usa solo cuando `mode: hawkbit`."},"5014":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-273","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Clave"},"5015":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-274","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Por defecto"},"5016":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-275","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Descripción"},"5017":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-276","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.base_url`"},"5018":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-277","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"ninguno (obligatoria)"},"5019":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-278","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Raíz de la API de gestión de hawkBit, por ejemplo `http://hawkbit:8080`. El arranque falla si está vacía. Las llamadas caducan a los 30 s; las transferencias de artefactos, a las 6 h."},"5020":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-279","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.username`, `hawkbit.password`"},"5021":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-280","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"ninguno"},"5022":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-281","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Credenciales Basic Auth de la API de gestión."},"5023":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-282","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.tenant`"},"5024":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-283","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`DEFAULT`"},"5025":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-284","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Segmento de ruta del tenant DDI."},"5026":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-285","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.ddi_url`"},"5027":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-286","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.base_url`"},"5028":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-287","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Raíz DDI de hawkBit **tal como la alcanzan los dispositivos** (por ejemplo `https://updates.example.com/api/hawkbit-ddi`). Se usa para construir las URLs de descarga que reciben los dispositivos, y su ruta pasa a ser el prefijo de la ruta de descarga DDI que sirve este servicio."},"5029":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-288","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"`hawkbit.artifact_store`"},"5030":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-289","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"ninguno"},"5031":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-290","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"Mismo formato que los bloques de almacenamiento de blobs: `storage` debe apuntar al bucket y al `s3_prefix` del plugin S3 de artefactos de hawkBit, y `presign` activa las descargas firmadas. Sin él, los artefactos se transmiten a través de hawkBit."},"5032":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-291","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#bloque-hawkbit","content":"El bloque `storage` (Postgres) también es obligatorio en modo `hawkbit`."},"5033":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-292","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Cualquier clave del fichero se puede sobrescribir con una variable de entorno: el nombre es la ruta de la clave en mayúsculas con los puntos sustituidos por guiones bajos. `KMS_ENDPOINT` sobrescribe `kms_endpoint`, `STORAGE_PASSWORD` sobrescribe `storage.password` y `BUILDS_PRESIGN_TTL` sobrescribe `builds.presign.ttl`. La clave debe existir en el fichero (basta con un valor vacío): el cargador solo considera las claves que ha leído de él."},"5034":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-293","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Variables que lee el código además de estas sobrescrituras:"},"5035":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-294","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Variable"},"5036":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-295","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Descripción"},"5037":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-296","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`OTA_CONFIG_FILE`"},"5038":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-297","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Ruta del fichero de configuración."},"5039":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-298","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`POD_NAME`, `POD_NAMESPACE`"},"5040":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-299","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Identidad y espacio de nombres para la elección de líder de Kubernetes. El chart de Helm las define. Si no están definidas, se usan el nombre de host y el fichero de espacio de nombres de la cuenta de servicio."},"5041":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-300","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`TMPDIR`"},"5042":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-301","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Dónde escriben ficheros temporales las subidas y las construcciones (el directorio temporal de Go)."},"5043":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-302","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`SERVER_PORT`"},"5044":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-303","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Solo lo usa la comprobación de salud de la imagen Docker para encontrar el puerto. Por defecto `10090`."},"5045":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-304","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"`AWS_*`"},"5046":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-305","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"La cadena de credenciales por defecto de AWS, cuando un bloque S3 o AWS KMS no tiene credencial explícita."},"5047":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-306","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"En Docker Compose, el fichero `.env` lo lee `docker-compose.yml`, no el servicio: `HOST_IP`, `HAWKBIT_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `HAWKBIT_ARTIFACT_STORAGE` y las variables `HAWKBIT_ARTIFACT_S3_*` y `LOCAL_S3_*`. Consulta `.env.example` en el repositorio."},"5048":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-307","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#variables-de-entorno","content":"Con `app.logs.level: debug`, el servicio escribe en el registro, al arrancar, toda la configuración cargada, incluidos `storage.password`, `encryption.local_key`, las claves de S3 y `hawkbit.password`. En modo `native`, el bloque `storage`, contraseña incluida, también se imprime en la salida estándar en cada arranque, sea cual sea el nivel de registro. Usa `info` o superior donde se almacenen o compartan los registros, y guarda los secretos en un gestor de secretos, no en el fichero (consulta las credenciales `*_file` más arriba)."},"5049":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-308","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#configuraciones-mínimas","content":"El modo `native` necesita la base de datos, los endpoints a los que llama y las rutas de almacenamiento. Parte de `config-docker.yml`:"},"5050":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-309","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#configuraciones-mínimas","content":"El modo `hawkbit` necesita `mode: hawkbit`, `hawkbit.base_url`, las credenciales de la API de gestión y el bloque `storage`. Añade los ajustes de construcción solo si quieres construir. Las claves siguientes son las que usa `config-hawkbit.yml`:"},"5051":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-310","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#configuraciones-mínimas","content":"En modo `hawkbit`, las rutas de SymKMS se registran solo cuando `symkms.storage.type` o `sym_keys_dir` están definidos. Con `symkms_endpoint` definido pero ninguno de los dos, el propio servicio respondería `404` a cada consulta de clave."},"5052":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-311","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#symkms-como-proceso-independiente","content":"El binario `cmd/symkms` ejecuta SymKMS en solitario. Su configuración solo tiene `app` (como arriba), `symkms` (un bloque de almacenamiento) y `sym_keys_dir`. Su directorio de claves es por defecto `/data/symmetric_keys` cuando no se define ni `symkms.storage.local_dir` ni `sym_keys_dir`. Sirve `/symkms/v1/*` pero no tiene ruta `/health`, y carece de autenticación igual que el monolito: consulta Seguridad."},"5053":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-312","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#páginas-relacionadas","content":"Operaciones para los valores de Helm, el escalado y las copias de seguridad."},"5054":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-313","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#páginas-relacionadas","content":"Modo hawkBit para lo que cambia en ese backend."},"5055":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-314","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#páginas-relacionadas","content":"Firma y cifrado para las claves que hay detrás de `kms_endpoint` y `symkms`."},"5056":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration-315","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/reference/configuration#páginas-relacionadas","content":"Resolución de problemas para los errores de arranque."},"5057":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"page","content":"Seguridad","breadcrumbs":["Docs","Plataforma","[Enterprise] Actualizaciones","Operación"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security"},"5058":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-0","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","content":"Qué protege y qué no protege Lamassu Updates, y qué poner a su alrededor antes de exponerlo."},"5059":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-1","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#resumen","content":"Resumen"},"5060":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-2","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-poner-delante","content":"Qué poner delante"},"5061":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-3","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#cómo-se-identifica-el-servicio-ante-otros","content":"Cómo se identifica el servicio ante otros"},"5062":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-4","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#rutas-a-restringir","content":"Rutas a restringir"},"5063":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-5","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#qué-comprueba-el-servicio","content":"Qué comprueba el servicio"},"5064":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-6","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#urls-de-descarga-prefirmadas","content":"URLs de descarga prefirmadas"},"5065":{"id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security-7","page_id":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/pr-preview/pr-56/es/platform/updates/security#conexiones-salientes","content":"Conexiones salientes"},"5066":